  "slug": "citizen-of-the-world",
  "audio_url": "/audio/russian/17892_citizen-of-the-world.mp3",
  "english_paragraphs": [
    "Where am I from? This question is difficult to answer. My father is American and my mother is Korean. I was born in Thailand, grew up in China, and now attend university in France. I love the culture of every place, I can speak the languages ​​of different countries, and I have many friends from different countries. If you ask me where I am from, I would say I am a citizen of the world. And you? Where are you from?"
  ],
  "english_full": "Where am I from? This question is difficult to answer. My father is American and my mother is Korean. I was born in Thailand, grew up in China, and now attend university in France. I love the culture of every place, I can speak the languages ​​of different countries, and I have many friends from different countries. If you ask me where I am from, I would say I am a citizen of the world. And you? Where are you from?",
  "russian_paragraphs": [
    "Отку́да я? Э́тот вопро́с тру́дный, чтобы отве́тить. Мой ба́тя америка́нец, а ма́ма коре́йка. Я роди́лся в Таила́нде, вы́рос в Кита́е, а сейча́с посеща́ю университе́т во Франции. Я люблю́ культу́ру ка́ждого ме́ста, могу́ говори́ть на язы́ках друго́их стран, и у меня́ мно́гие друзья́ из разны́х стран. Если вы спра́шиваете меня́, отку́да я, я скажу́, что я граждани́н ми́ра. А вы? Где вы?"
  ],
  "reading_paragraphs": [
    "Otkudá ya? Étot voprós trúdnyy, chtoby otvétit'. Moy bátya amerikánets, a máma koreýka. Ya rodílsya v Taílánde, výros v Kitáye, a seychás posetájú universitét vo Fráncii. Ya lyublyú kultúru kázhdogo mésta, mogú govorít' na yazýkakh drugóikh stran, i u menyá mnógie druz'á iz raznýkh stran. Yesli vy spráshivaete mená, otkudá ya, ya skazhú, chto ya grazhdanín míra. A vy? Gde vy?"
  ],
